      "comment": "ULTIMATE EQUUS (2) has been competitive of late. Runner-up two back at this circuit and distance and kept the ball rolling last time when he drew wider and raced parked but stuck on well when only 2.4 metres from the winner. Should enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position so has strong claims. Manners let FAKISTRA (4) down last start but he had looked close to a win prior, recording three straight placings here. Give him another chance. STILLYOURSHOT NZ (3) has raced at Menangle in both starts since switching from a Queensland yard, finishing third from a wide barrier two back. Draws well and this suits. TULHURST TIMMY (8) draws out again but is only one spot wider than when recording a win and a close second in his last two outings here.",
